      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, I wonder if we should just disable the non-OTP test for `helipilot`-based boards, [similar to how we don\u0027t run the OTP version of the test on boards without OTP](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/test/run_device_tests.py;l\u003d642-644;drc\u003dc9b9833d840846f25238a8fcfd198a9f7a3b506a). Since `helipilot` boards always have OTP enabled, I\u0027m not sure it\u0027s worth testing the non-OTP version on `helipilot`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "7b67ba3ae5cd10d36d5e91e22effd6a6da4a1fdc",
