      "writtenOn": "2025-07-10T17:50:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can just remove `fpsensor_auth_crypto_stateful_otp`. `fpsensor_auth_crypto_stateful` will run with `CONFIG_OTP_KEY` for `helipilot` because it is enabled in the baseboard. It will also run without `CONFIG_OTP_KEY` for `bloonchipper` because it is not enabled in the baseboard.\n\nPlease let me know if you are ok with this and I can make this change. We just need `fpsensor_auth_crypto_stateful` unit test.",
      "parentUuid": "d1b953ee_4c6a9e4a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 1,
