      "writtenOn": "2025-07-11T16:28:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s a good idea. To make sure we don\u0027t accidentally disable OTP for helipilot-based boards, let\u0027s also add some kind of check in the test that `OTP` is enabled when building for `helipilot`. Something like:\n\n```\nif (IS_ENABLED(BASEBOARD_HELIPILOT))\n  BUILD_ASSERT(IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_OTP_KEY));\n```\n\nIf the above doesn\u0027t work, you may need to change to:\n\n```\n#if defined(BASEBOARD_HELIPILOT)\nBUILD_ASSERT(IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_OTP_KEY));\n#endif\n```",
